 431	# Updating using Terraform
 432	**Until this project is migrated to the AWS Serverless Application Model (SAM), updates will have to be done as described below:**
 433	1. Pull the latest code from git repository for AHA.
 434	2. Update the parameters file terraform.tfvars per your requirement
 435	3. Copy the terraform template files to directory where your previous state exists
 436	4. Deploy the templates as below
 437	```
 438	$ cd aws-health-aware
 439	$ git pull https://github.com/aws-samples/aws-health-aware.git
 440	$ cd terraform/Terraform_DEPLOY_AHA
 441	$ terraform init
 442	$ terraform plan - This command should show any difference existing config and latest code.
 443	$ terraform apply
 444	```
 445	
 446	**If for some reason, you still have issues after updating, you can easily just delete the stack and redeploy. The infrastructure can be destroyed and rebuilt within minutes through Terraform.**
